  attachedPhoto: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 14a1463ef81f6884ab8034e66163ec22, type: 3}
  logText: The writing system seems to focus on characters made from several detailed
    strokes in a vertical line, slightly resembling our own languages of Asian origins.
    The red drawing on the right almost feels like a warning or notice of some kind,
    and probably isn't an actual word but a symbol instead.  The most interesting
    thing in this mural is the squid-like drawings. Makes me wonder if the organisms
    here evolved in a similar way as they did on Earth.
